# Keep the Docker build context small: the image only compiles crates/devall-cli, but cargo needs
# every workspace member's manifest and sources to resolve Cargo.lock.
.git
.github
target
**/target
**/node_modules
apps/desktop/dist
apps/desktop/src
apps/desktop/public
apps/desktop/src-tauri/gen
apps/desktop/src-tauri/icons
relay
reports
research_notes
docs
examples
**/*.ipynb
**/.devall
**/.env
**/.env.*
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
